# Clarifying Questions

- When clarification is required, use the interactive question dialog instead of asking in plain chat.
- Ask only questions that materially affect the result and cannot be resolved from the request, codebase, or sensible defaults.
- Provide concise, mutually distinct options and mark the recommended option when one is clearly preferable.
- Allow custom input so the user can provide an answer not covered by the options.
- Group independent clarifying questions into one dialog when practical.
